---
interface Props {
  pending?: boolean;
  title?: string;
  description?: string;
  industry?: string;
  scope?: string;
  href?: string;
}

const { pending = false, title, description, industry, scope, href } = Astro.props;
---

<article class:list={['case-card', pending && 'case-card-pending']}>
  {pending ? (
    <>
      <span class="case-card-mark" aria-hidden="true">MW</span>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark"><span></span>PUBLIC CASES</p>
        <h3>검증·승인된 프로젝트 사례를 준비 중입니다</h3>
        <p>고객명·수행 범위·성과는 근거와 공개 승인이 확인된 경우에만 게시합니다.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href={href ?? '/experience/'}>수행 역량 살펴보기 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </>
  ) : (
    <>
      <div class="case-card-meta"><span>{industry}</span><span>{scope}</span></div>
      <h3>{title}</h3>
      <p>{description}</p>
      {href && <a class="text-link" href={href}>사례 자세히 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>}
    </>
  )}
</article>
